# Raw flash-flood preprocessing inputs (large binary rasters + source basin
# boundaries) — only needed to *regenerate* somalia_basins_ffsi.geojson via
# backend/scripts/preprocess_flood_data.py. Two of these exceed GitHub's
# 100MB file-size limit. The app only needs the preprocessed output below,
# which IS tracked.
flash floods base data/*.tif
flash floods base data/somalia_basins.geojson
!flash floods base data/somalia_basins_ffsi.geojson
